---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about the mission, audience, and topics for the What\'s Next? conference series.">
  <section class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/80 p-10 shadow-soft">
    <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-8">
      <p class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-zenika-accentSoft px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-zenika-accent">Conference series</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">About What&apos;s Next?</h1>
      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">What&apos;s Next? is a recurring mini-conference series led by Zenika Singapore that explores the next phase of AI-driven development. It connects technology leaders with practitioners across Singapore and the region to share practical stories, tools, and strategies for modern AI transformation.</p>
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Mission</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 leading-7">Help organisations understand how AI changes the way software is built, operated, and governed — without turning the event into a vendor pitch.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Who it&apos;s for</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 leading-7">Senior leadership, engineering and AI teams, transformation sponsors, and decision-makers looking for a concise, practical forum on AI adoption.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/80 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-zenika-accent">Topics covered</h3>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
            <li>Agentic AI workflows</li>
            <li>AI tools for engineering productivity</li>
            <li>AI transformation stories</li>
            <li>Responsible enterprise adoption</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/80 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-zenika-accent">Approach</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 leading-7">Deliver concise, high-impact sessions that prioritize practical insight, networking, and real-world application over theoretical debate.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/80 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-zenika-accent">Why it matters</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 leading-7">AI is reshaping how teams build software. What&apos;s Next? helps leaders spot the next practical moves, not just the latest hype.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
